---
layout: base.njk
title: On-going
description: 1ヶ月経過したけれども期限がまだ来ていない動画、あるいはYoutubeなどの期限が設定されていないものをまとめたページ
pagination:
  data: collections.ongoing
  size: 7
  alias: posts
---

<div class="ongoing-container">

  <div class="header">
    {{ description }}
  </div>

  {% set tracker = { year: "" } %}

  {% for post in posts %}
    {% set postYear = post.date.getFullYear() %}

    {# 前回の記事と年が変わったタイミングでのみ h2 を出力 #}
    {% if postYear != tracker.year %}
      <h2 class="currentYear">{{ postYear }}</h2>
      {% set tracker = { year: postYear } %}
    {% endif %}

    <article class="post-card">
      <div class="post-card-meta">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | dateISO }}">{{ post.date | dateJP }}</time>
        {% if post.data.tags %}
          <div class="post-card-tags">
            {% for tag in post.data.tags | excludeTag("posts") %}
              <span class="post-tag">{{ tag }}</span>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <h2 class="post-card-title">
        <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
        <svg role="img" width="13.35px" height="13.35px" class="line-left-to-up"><use href="#line-left-to-up"></use></svg>
      </h2>
      {% if post.data.description %}
        <p class="post-card-excerpt">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
      {% endif %}
    </article>
  {% endfor %}

  <article class="post-card">
    <h2 class="post-card-title">
      <a href="/ongoing/youtube/youtube-ongoing/">test youtube</a>
      <svg role="img" width="13.35px" height="13.35px" class="line-left-to-up"><use href="#line-left-to-up"></use></svg>
    </h2>
  </article>
</div>
